  "adapter_policy": "The story sheet of a project (user 2026-10-27): the description of its fields as it was when filled and the value of each field by code, as a table module of the project database intermediary (qnc-db-broker): project_story_sheet, project_story_values and their public views. It owns only its tables, is written only through the intermediary and knows no form or application.",
  "specification": "AGENTS.md"
